nonmutating preflight before ticket, reconciler, or Jira mutation.\n- Keep connected probes outside CI.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] Jira setup guidance names no default or fallback project.\n- [x] Neither probe substitutes DIG or another project when JIRA_PROJECT is absent.\n- [x] Probe defaults use the checkout virtual environment, and REBAR_ENGINE_DIR plus REBAR_TICKET_CLI overrides still work.\n- [x] Each probe requires documented mutation opt-in and fails before mutation when project, credentials, executable, import capability, or opt-in is absent.\n- [x] No repository reference remains to scripts/jira-onboarding-reference.\n- [x] No CI workflow invokes the connected probes.\n- [x] Focused preflight tests, bash syntax checks, shellcheck, lint, and type checking pass.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Run `pytest tests/scripts/test_jira_pressure_test_preflight.py`.\n- Run `bash -n scripts/jira-pressure-test/e2e_validation_probe.sh scripts/jira-pressure-test/e2e_field_validation_probe.sh`.\n- Run `shellcheck scripts/jira-pressure-test/e2e_validation_probe.sh scripts/jira-pressure-test/e2e_field_validation_probe.sh`.\n- Run `make lint` and `make typecheck` with the checkout virtual environment first on PATH.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"docs/jira-sync-setup.md","reason":"Require explicit Jira project selection with no fallback project."},{"path":"docs/config.md","reason":"Correct the stale claim that an unset Jira project substitutes DIG."},{"path":"scripts/jira-onboarding-reference/README.md","reason":"Delete the obsolete onboarding reference."},{"path":"scripts/jira-onboarding-reference/jira-credential-helper.sh","reason":"Delete the obsolete onboarding helper."},{"path":"scripts/jira-onboarding-reference/test-jira-credential-helper.sh","reason":"Delete the obsolete onboarding helper test."},{"path":"scripts/jira-pressure-test/README.md","reason":"Document explicit project selection, virtual environment use, mutation opt-i